  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Natural Resources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project works with member countries on a bilateral and multi-lateral basis to improve the management and governance of natural resources. The Secretariat will support member countries through technical assistance to develop national policies, laws, fiscal regimes, institutional and contractual arrangements to ensure they reflect international best practices and are context appropriate; strengthen institutional capacity; and shape global action in a way that benefits member countries especially small states and least developed countries.?? 

?</narrative>
